    "title": "Peek Inside Clingstone, Rhode Island's Legendary \"House on the Rocks\" - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Aimee Tucker ,\n11 hours ago From grand Gilded Age estates to weathered seaside retreats, the summer cottages of coastal Rhode Island tell the story of generations of families. In Summer by the Sea: Cottages from Watch Hill to Little Compton, architect Thomas A. Kligerman explores the history, architecture, and enduring appeal of these remarkable homes through richly detailed essays and evocative photography. As you turn the pages, the dreamy sights and sounds of a New England summer by the sea make it almost inevitable that you’ll find yourself browsing Zillow for an escape of your own—or, at the very least, Airbnb. Read full article\n7",
